# Git & Documentation
- **Commits:** Use [Conventional Commits](https://www.conventionalcommits.org/) (e.g., `feat:`, `fix:`, `docs:`, `refactor:`).
- **Docstrings:** Use **Google Style** docstrings for all Python functions.
- **Change Logs:** If you modify a VAST API wrapper, remind the user to update the `README.md` or the version number if applicable.
